OL,3,GNEWSAIOPC names man found in river
OL,4,Aafter police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose body was found in a river
OL,7,Fafter he was chased by police has been
OL,8,Fnamed by an independent watchdog.
OL,10,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,11,FConduct (IOPC) said officers had
OL,12,Fcontact with Myley French, 20, in
OL,13,FStanstead Abbotts, Hertfordshire, after
OL,14,Frecognising him as being wanted for
OL,15,Ffailing to answer bail.
OL,17,FThey stopped and spoke to French
OL,18,F"briefly" on the High Street, before he
OL,19,Fclimbed over a fence and then entered
OL,20,Fthe River Lea on 14 September.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
